# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF and let each checkout use
# its own platform's endings - except the shell scripts, which are streamed
# from this Windows working copy to the RHEL host by tools/deploy_rhel.sh and
# would fail to run there with CRLF.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
# Same reason: systemd refuses a unit file with CRLF, and QSettings reads a
# CRLF .conf but writes it back with LF, which turns every save into a whole
# file diff.
*.service text eol=lf
*.conf.sample text eol=lf
